      "amount": "1/4 cup"
    },
    {
      "name": "chopped walnuts",
      "amount": "1/4 cup"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "In a small saucepan, heat the heavy cream over medium heat until warm",
    "In a copper mug, combine the diced pears, rolled oats, almond butter, honey, cinnamon, and vanilla extract",
    "Pour the warm heavy cream over the pear mixture in the copper mug",
    "Top with chopped walnuts",
    "Serve immediately",
    "Let it cool for a few minutes before eating",
    "You can adjust the amount of honey to your taste",
    "Consider using a stone bowl or dolsot for a more traditional experience"
  ],
